        -> ...
<<else>>
    <<show_character Cat Neutral right>>
    The alien appears on the screen.
    <<start_voice_blip Cat>>
    {$catName}: Hello. Talk!
        -> I want to get to know you better.
            <<show_character Cat Thinking right>>
            {$catName}: ...Okay. Talk more.
<<endif>>
<<declare $knowCatPasttime = false>>
<<declare $knowCatJob = false>>
<<jump CatConvoDay2>>
